{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"سنن ابن ماجه","section":{"37":"Zuhd"},"section_detail":{"37":{"hadithnumber_first":4100,"hadithnumber_last":4341,"arabicnumber_first":4100,"arabicnumber_last":4341,"name_native":"زهد"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4258,"arabicnumber":4258,"text":"حدثنا محمود بن غيلان، حدثنا الفضل بن موسى، عن محمد بن عمرو، عن ابي سلمة، عن ابي هريرة، قال قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم : \" اكثروا ذكر هاذم اللذات \" . يعني الموت","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":37,"hadith":159}}]}